# T33380 (229) Management_SSH - SSH Server (IPv4) -- working log, RUN 2

**Run 2 exists for ONE limb.** Run 1 (group A, 2026-10-21 13:2x) measured everything else in
this case and graded it PASS, but recorded its **reboot-persistence limb as NOT MEASURED**: at
that time, proving `no service ssh ip` survives a reboot needed a `write`, and a `write` would
